# social-phone

=========== Herramientas utilizadas en social-phone ===========
-phoneinfoga

=========== Crear imagen ===========
docker build -t phoneinfoga .

=========== Inicar contenedor ===========
docker run --rm -it \
  -p 5000:5000 \
  phoneinfoga

=========== Usar phoneinfoga ===========
http://localhost:5000
ó
docker run --rm phoneinfoga scan -n "+5493511234567"
